msgstr "AIC"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "BIC"
msgstr "BIC"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "Difference"
msgstr "Différence"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid ""
"Differences the dependent variable. Note that differencing leads to a "
"shorter time-series (n - lag) as a lag is used."
msgstr "Différencie la variable dépendante. Notez que la différenciation conduit à "
"une série temporelle plus courte (n - décalage) car un décalage est "
"utilisé."

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "Lag"
msgstr "Décalage"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordre"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "Append transformation to spreadsheet"
msgstr "Ajouter la transformation à la feuille de calcul"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid ""
"Appends the transformed dependent variable to the spreadsheet, so these can "
"be used in further analyses."
msgstr "Ajoute la variable dépendante transformée à la feuille de calcul, afin "
"qu'elle puisse être utilisée dans des analyses ultérieures."

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "Column name"
msgstr "Nom de la colonne"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "e.g., transformed"
msgstr "par ex., transformé"

